      "before": "kpk1-l07-b4-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "A ticket for the bus"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "At a kiosk you can buy a ticket: *bilet na autobus*. A *bilet normalny* is the full price; a *bilet ulgowy* is cheaper, for school pupils and students. Coins are *monety*, notes are *banknoty*, and *drobne* is small change. *Kupić* is to buy once: *muszę kupić bilet*."
      }
    }
  ],
